sequenceDiagram
 participant C as MCP Client/Host
 participant S as Stateless MCP Server
 participant U as User
 participant T as Durable Task Store
 C->>S: tools/call + stateless _meta
 S-->>C: resultType=input_required + inputRequests + signed requestState
 C->>U: Render elicitation form
 U-->>C: Accept / decline / cancel
 C->>S: Retry original tools/call + inputResponses + same requestState
 S->>S: Verify signature, expiry, tenant and response schema
 S-->>C: resultType=complete
 C->>T: tasks/get or tasks/cancel
 T-->>C: task status + result / cancel intent
 C->>S: subscriptions/listen(task IDs)
 S-->>C: notifications/tasks
